{
  "name": "Qualify new leads with an AI phone call from Google Sheets using Ringee",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automatic lead qualification\nEvery new row in your leads sheet gets a phone call from an AI voice agent that asks your qualifying questions. When the call ends, the row is updated with the outcome, a summary and what the person said.\n\n**Sheet columns:** `Name`, `Phone`, `Company`, `Status`, `Outcome`, `Summary`, `Sentiment`. Leave `Status` empty on new rows.\n\n[Ringee](https://ringee.io) · [Docs](https://docs.ringee.io)",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8d19391e-e965-5c45-9727-c72bd6cbc385",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Before you run this**\n1. In Ringee, create a **Custom Integration** (Integrations → Custom Integrations) and copy its **API key** and **Signing Secret**.\n2. In n8n, create a **Ringee API** credential with both.\n3. Pick your AI voice agent in the Ringee node.\n4. Activate the workflow, then paste the **Ringee Trigger's Production URL** into the integration's **Outbound URL** and tick *Call Completed* and *Call Failed*.\n\nUse an agent of type **Appointment Booking** configured with your qualifying questions. Connect **Google Sheets** on the three Google nodes and choose the same spreadsheet and sheet on each.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "8ea19ea7-4482-5577-8062-205665f41cb7",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Consent and calling hours**\nOnly call people who agreed to be called, and only at reasonable hours. Ringee blocks numbers on your Do-Not-Call list and respects your plan's limits, but you are responsible for the permission to call. Every phone number in this template is fictional.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "604fedf7-9647-52ce-912d-0eaa123b438b",
      "name": "Consent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "rowAdded",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyX",
              "value": 5,
              "unit": "minutes"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "dbcaf410-5e00-5e59-a6a6-2ec610e62027",
      "name": "New lead row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
